<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1020', fontFamily: 'Arial', padding: '52px 60px 30px 60px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4D8DFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2.2 }}>07 · RESULTS (4/6) — H2</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8 }}>
        κ is negative — but Λ never halves
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#24334C', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 640, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#7E93AE', letterSpacing: 1.2, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                ALTERNATING COPOLYMER · Λ AGAINST TRAINING ROWS (5 FOLDS)
            </Text>
            <Chart
                style={{ width: 640, height: 300, marginTop: 6 }}
                chartType='lineChart'
                colors={['#4D8DFF']}
                background='#0E1728'
                showLegend={false}
                showDataLabels={true}
                axisColor='#8FA3BC'
                dataLabelColor='#FFFFFF'
                data={[
                    ['training rows', 'Λ'],
                    ['300', 0.2946],
                    ['1,000', 0.5029],
                    ['3,000', 0.3675],
                    ['10,000', 0.2785],
                    ['all 22,242', 0.1915],
                ]}
            />
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FF6B6B', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>−0.0863</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8FA3BC', marginTop: 4 }}>κ, 95% interval [−0.1053, −0.0672] — entirely below zero</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFB020', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>0.650</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8FA3BC', marginTop: 4 }}>Λ at the largest n ÷ Λ at the smallest n — needs &lt; 0.5 to halve</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#C3D0E2', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 2 }}>
                H2 needs <span style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>both</span> conditions: a significantly negative κ and a halved Λ.
                The first holds, the second does not — so H2 is <span style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>not refuted</span>, and also not confirmed.
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#A8B8CE', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                The shape is a hump, not a line: +0.295 → +0.503 → +0.192. A single slope hides the fact that the first step goes up.
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginTop: 'auto' }}>
        {[
            ['PRE-REGISTERED', '−0.086 / 0.650', 'all levels, smallest as start'],
            ['DROP SMALLEST LEVEL', '−0.224', 'sign holds: [−0.241, −0.205]'],
            ['DENOMINATOR ≥ 0.05 ONLY', '+0.398', 'sign flips — two largest levels'],
            ['START AT THE PEAK (POST HOC)', '0.380', 'would refute; not used'],
        ].map(([label, value, note]) => (
            <Box key={label} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '10px 14px', background: '#111B2E', border: '1px solid #24334C', borderRadius: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: '#7E93AE', letterSpacing: 1 }}>{label}</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>{value}</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#8FA3BC', marginTop: 3, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{note}</Text>
            </Box>
        ))}
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#5E7590' }}>
            kappa.csv · Homopolymer: no slope reported (top two levels only 0.158 dex apart); its endpoint difference is +0.647, with no interval.
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#5E7590' }}>11 / 17</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
